                        </svg>
                        We do not give children lifts, meet them outside the workshops, or take them anywhere alone. 
                        Building access is arranged so that parents can enter at the start and end of each session, 
                        and external doors are kept closed once everyone is inside.
                    </dt>
                </div>
            </dl>
            <h2 class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-emerald-800 sm:text-4xl">
                8. Adults' conduct and one-to-one contact
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xl sm:mt-4">
                Adults involved in the workshops will:
            </p>
            <dl class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 max-w-xl space-y-8 text-xl leading-7 lg:max-w-none">
