            <h2 class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-emerald-800 sm:text-4xl">
                9. Recognising a concern
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xl sm:mt-4">
                A concern may be something a child says or does, something a parent tells us, or something we notice 
                ourselves. Signs can include:
            </p>
            <dl class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 max-w-xl space-y-8 text-xl leading-7 lg:max-w-none">
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        A child saying something that worries them, or hinting at harm.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Unexplained injuries, or a child who is unusually anxious, withdrawn, or fearful.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        A child who is reluctant to go home, or who arrives or leaves in a way that concerns us.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        A child who has been sent or shown something online that worries them.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Concern about the behaviour of an adult towards a child.
                    </dt>
                </div>
            </dl>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xl sm:mt-4">
                The main categories of abuse are physical abuse, sexual abuse, emotional abuse and neglect. 
                No single sign proves that a child is being harmed. Any concern should be taken seriously and recorded.
            </p>
            <h2 class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-emerald-800 sm:text-4xl">
                10. Responding to a disclosure
            </h2>
            <dl class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 max-w-xl space-y-8 text-xl leading-7 lg:max-w-none">
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Stay calm, and listen carefully.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Don't ask leading questions, and don't investigate.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Reassure the child that they have done the right thing by telling you, and that you 
                        will try to help.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Don't promise to keep the information secret, and don't ask probing questions.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Write down what the child said as soon as possible, using their own words where you can. 
                        Include who the child is, when it happened, what was said, what you did next, and who you 
                        reported it to. Don't assume or add detail to your notes.
                    </dt>
                </div>
            </dl>
            <h2 class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-emerald-800 sm:text-4xl">
                11. Reporting a concern
            </h2>
            <dl class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 max-w-xl space-y-8 text-xl leading-7 lg:max-w-none">
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        If a child is in immediate danger, or someone is seriously hurt, call 999.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        For a non-emergency concern about a child, contact Perth and Kinross Council's 
                        Children's Social Work team: 01738 476  768 24-hour line.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        For a concern about a crime, or for police advice, contact Police Scotland on 101, or 
                        999 in an emergency.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        As a STEM Ambassador, also inform the STEM Learning Safeguarding team at 
                        safeguarding@stem.org.uk as soon as possible. For advice about a concern, the NSPCC 
                        Helpline is 0808 800 5000. Childline is 0800 1111 for children and young people themselves.
                    </dt>
                </div>
            </dl>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xl sm:mt-4">
                Do not wait for proof before reporting a concern. You don't need to be certain, and it is not your job 
                to investigate.
            </p>
            <h2 id="section-12" class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-emerald-800 sm:text-4xl">
                12. Concerns about an adult
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xl sm:mt-4">
                If a concern is about Kerry Kidd, or about any adult involved in the workshops:
            </p>
            <dl class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 max-w-xl space-y-8 text-xl leading-7 lg:max-w-none">
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Report it straight away to the local children's social work team, or to Police Scotland 
                        (999 in an emergency) if a child is at immediate risk. RaspiKidd has no deputy, so there 
                        is no internal lead to report to.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        For a non-emergency concern about a child, contact Perth and Kinross Council's 
                        Children's Social Work team: 01738 476  768 24-hour line.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Do not investigate the concern yourself, or discuss it with the person concerned.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
