            </dl>
            <h2 class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-emerald-800 sm:text-4xl">
                13. Working with parents
            </h2>
            <dl class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 max-w-xl space-y-8 text-xl leading-7 lg:max-w-none">
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Where it is safe to do so, and where it will not put the child at risk, we will tell parents 
                        or guardians about a concern.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Some concerns must be passed to the local authority or the police before we speak to parents. 
                        Follow the advice of the agency you have contacted.
                    </dt>
                </div>
            </dl>
            <h2 class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-emerald-800 sm:text-4xl">
                14. Recording and information sharing
            </h2>
            <dl class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 max-w-xl space-y-8 text-xl leading-7 lg:max-w-none">
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Keep a written record of every concern, including what was seen or heard, the action taken, 
                        and who was informed. Use the concern record form.
                    </dt>
                </div>
                <div class="relative ml-8 pl-9 text-xl">
                    <dt class="inline text-gray-700">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 
                            stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-7 text-brand">
